  "details": "Groups have image galleries. But, what if we can have galleries right on our profiles directly? I'd love to post pictures of my friends and cool memories I've had for people to see under my profile by my avatars and worlds I made!\n\nOf course, this should have moderation options like stickers or any other content, and also visibility options, like if I only want my friends to see it.\n\nIt can be a great showcase for those of us who partake in photography and want to show our work!",
